   1:Source/render/style.c **** /*
   2:Source/render/style.c ****  * PlutoBrowser — style.c
   3:Source/render/style.c ****  * Typography & styling (port of Source/render/style.lua). See style.h.
   4:Source/render/style.c ****  * Reference behavior preserved:
   5:Source/render/style.c ****  *   - heading1 = Roobert-20-Medium, heading2 = heading3 = bodyBold =
   6:Source/render/style.c ****  *     Roobert-10-Bold, body = Roobert-11-Medium, mono = Roobert-11-Mono-
   7:Source/render/style.c ****  *     Condensed; every load falls back to the system font on failure.
   8:Source/render/style.c ****  *   - getTextWidth: empty → 0; fallback estimate len*8.
   9:Source/render/style.c ****  *   - getHeadingFont: (24,6) / (18,5) / (16,4); getBodyFont: mono 15,
  10:Source/render/style.c ****  *     bold 16, regular 16; getInlineFont: code 15, small/sub/sup 14,
  11:Source/render/style.c ****  *     bold/big 16, regular 16.
  12:Source/render/style.c ****  */
